# Route: guide 34 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to
# 56, 102 quests, 3.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim
# run --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10):
# fix a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export
# keeps it.
#
# Flow (Undercity, The Hinterlands, Orgrimmar, Felwood, Thunder Bluff,
# Azshara, Ashenvale, Alterac Mountains): Undercity -> near Undercity ->
# Undercity -> near Undercity -> Undercity -> near Undercity -> Undercity ->
# near Undercity -> Undercity -> Hiri'watha -> Shadra'Alor -> Quel'Danil Lodge
# -> Jintha'Alor -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Star, the Hand and the Heart
# (736; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44);
# Recover the Key! (7846; Hitah'ya the Keeper 51); Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx
# and Her Minions (7861; Vile Priestess Hexx 51, Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guard
# 50-51); Shadowshard Fragments (7068; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard
# Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38); Allegiance to the Old Gods (6564;
# Blackfathom Tide Priestess 20-21); The Crown of Will (518; Crushridge Mauler
# 36-37).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Book of Ur (1013), The Book of Ur (1013), Going,
# Going, Guano! (1109), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Bring the End (3341), The
# Power to Destroy... (5725), Light's Justice (92421), Light's Justice
# (92421), The New Plague (95216), Source of Power (96988), Jammal'an the
# Prophet (1446), Necklace Recovery, Take 2 (2284), Rig Wars (2841), Rig Wars
# (2841), The Royal Rescue (4003), For The Horde! (4974), Returning the Lost
# Satchel (5724), Hidden Enemies (5728), Hidden Enemies (5728), Slaying the
# Beast (5761), Slaying the Beast (5761), Changing Tastes (95697), Changing
# Tastes (95697), Leaders of the Fang (914), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing
# an Enemy's Strength (5723), Blackfathom Villainy (6561), Allegiance to the
# Old Gods (6565), Allegiance to the Old Gods (6565), Amongst the Ruins
# (6921), Amongst the Ruins (6921), Baron Aquanis (6922), Heart of Disruption
# (96984), The Grave Knight (96986), Opportunistic Education (96987).

